{"description": "<h2 data-local-id=\"abc74c5948d2\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"heading\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">What you'll be solving</h2>\n<p data-local-id=\"cdaed0451f8d\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">A platform engineer opens their AI client of choice, connects it to CAST AI, and types: <em data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"em\">\"Why did our spend jump 40% in eu-west last week?\"</em> Thirty seconds later they have an answer, pulled from live cluster state and cost data, with links back to the evidence. No dashboards. No YAML archaeology. Just a question and a correct, permission-checked answer.</p>\n<p data-local-id=\"b8494f479046\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Your job is to make that interaction boring. Reliably, securely, at production scale.</p>\n<p data-local-id=\"50f8133f28bf\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Behind it sits the hard part: an AI assistant that reasons over thousands of production Kubernetes clusters, a platform that safely exposes company infrastructure to external AI clients, and quality pipelines that tell us when the agent is wrong before a customer does. Get it right, and operators stop clicking through consoles entirely. Get it wrong once, and an agent gives a confidently wrong answer to someone managing production.</p>\n<p data-local-id=\"8e942e75a139\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">CAST AI already runs Kubernetes infrastructure autonomously. Our automation makes thousands of cost-and-reliability decisions a day. Cast Pilot is the team building the intelligence layer on top of that: <strong data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"strong\">AI assistants for Kubernetes and the cloud itself</strong>. Our assistant already answers thousands of questions a month from hundreds of organizations. Now we're opening the platform up: a public, permission-aware MCP server so customers can plug CAST AI straight into their own AI clients and agents, deeper connectivity across all three major clouds (AWS, GCP, Azure), and a continuous push to make our agents smarter, better grounded, and more capable.</p>\n<p data-local-id=\"a1e0ed738677\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">This is greenfield AI platform work on top of battle-tested infrastructure. Most features ship in 1 to 4 weeks.</p>\n<p data-local-id=\"b569d0157071\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">This is a location-specific opportunity. We are currently accepting applications from candidates residing in the following European countries: Bulgaria, Croatia, Estonia, Greece, Hungary, Latvia, Lithuania, Poland, Romania, Slovakia, Cyprus, Malta, Finland, Sweden, Ireland, Moldova, North Macedonia, Montenegro, Slovenia, and Ukraine.</p>\n<h2 data-local-id=\"fd16b6466fe1\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"heading\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Requirements</h2>\n<ul class=\"ak-ul\" data-local-id=\"0ab5b207-fb49-44a9-b5b5-887dc58a459d\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"bulletList\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<li data-local-id=\"2a9c2ac0-fa30-416c-9bdd-a768aaa281f5\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"47963ac0b0a9\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Strong software engineering fundamentals: you design clean abstractions, write maintainable code, and can justify your architecture choices, not just make something work. You're a <strong data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"strong\">generalist</strong> who is as comfortable debugging a distributed system as designing an auth flow or tuning an agent's behavior.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"820dcc3d-0c29-41de-9fd9-887f7d7da066\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"66cd3ec8f099\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><span id=\"4ee96974-f7e3-4b3a-a428-4fdafd49ba4d\" data-mark-type=\"annotation\" data-mark-annotation-type=\"inlineComment\" data-id=\"4ee96974-f7e3-4b3a-a428-4fdafd49ba4d\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"annotation\">Production experience</span> with Go is strongly preferred; candidates without Go should demonstrate strong systems programming skills in a comparable language.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"8b35686433f5\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"81e47bc3c71a\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Experience building or operating large-scale SaaS platforms in production: multi-tenant systems, high volumes, and the failure modes that only show up at scale.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"495921b0-8d76-4280-85cf-bf820b104622\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"00053900525c\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Solid understanding of Kubernetes. Our entire platform runs on it, and the assistants we build answer questions <em data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"em\">about</em> it. You should be at home with autoscaling, scheduling, and networking concepts.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"87f1373e-e358-4c85-9214-43966d7e0672\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"7e35e363b2fe\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">You've personally driven a complex project end-to-end.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"151654dd-6723-4b81-b891-c95a37041da1\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"a118d709d111\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Hands-on experience with AI coding agents and agentic development workflows. This is how we build, not just what we build.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"787850de-a33f-4e12-9706-20199d39eab1\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"fa7350771ad5\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">You've used observability tooling in production.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"8387a5f2-70c8-449d-8116-671cc94317b6\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"7779056aa1a2\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">CI/CD and DevOps practices experience.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"195f472c-d9a9-438f-b058-4672c71e3eba\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"6278843f373d\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Strong English skills, both verbal and written.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"986aefad-f318-49c3-affe-76d8a27a3949\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"54f6777a81a2\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Startup mindset: adaptable, proactive, and comfortable with ambiguity.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-local-id=\"152e1c69b3a2\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"heading\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">What will make you stand out</h2>\n<ul class=\"ak-ul\" data-local-id=\"9b5b017f-c1e6-49ab-96d5-911ffbdd5992\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"bulletList\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<li data-local-id=\"6bb7faac-ac0d-4e8f-87c1-ae41e5d231ec\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"fd73bc7679ef\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><strong data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"strong\">You've built agentic systems that shipped</strong>: MCP servers or clients, agent gateways, tool-use orchestration, RAG pipelines, evaluation frameworks, and you can talk about what broke in production and how you found out. This is the single biggest differentiator for our team.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"96688ecd-6198-4a8a-acb0-6b6ce0c7089f\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"40f75a9f63c1\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Deep hands-on experience with one or more of AWS, GCP, or Azure, with real understanding of IAM, compute, networking, and their APIs, not just console-level usage.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"7637d2c2-bbdf-4b96-ade8-4d1c6f42da17\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"cfb7c3eff024\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Experience with LLM application quality: evaluations, prompt engineering at scale, latency and cost optimization of agent loops.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"f79f470d-1e8e-40f0-85f9-0f4f1d869168\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"08b96fc31216\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Knowledge of OAuth 2.0 / OIDC and multi-tenant authorization design.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"aac290d5-b35e-4f9b-9db8-3e26856b637c\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"44ee3d3ba187\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Deep knowledge of EKS, GKE, or AKS internals.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"aff686d2-c86f-4373-be7e-3bee77b25eb0\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"15808d13edf3\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Kubernetes or cloud-native OSS contributions.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-local-id=\"5d36cb0b0896\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"heading\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Responsibilities</h2>\n<ul class=\"ak-ul\" data-local-id=\"93be5ca0-3e25-4231-8ec5-09b75a6c767d\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"bulletList\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<li data-local-id=\"54f4af5f-5cd4-4d3c-b252-eed0e1a5b2bd\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"4c5a5d590dd8\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Design and build the systems behind our AI assistant: agent flows, context retrieval, and the data connections that let it reason about live Kubernetes infrastructure.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"5dab4aaf-a6ef-48bb-bf77-38f03c63fbbd\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"60937400e947\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Build and evolve our <strong data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"strong\">public, permission-aware MCP server</strong>: curated tools, identity, audit, and strict safety gates, so customers can use CAST AI from their own AI clients.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"86c9eae4-70dc-4889-b365-cded756e265b\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"35b66fcbd904\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Develop and maintain cloud connectivity across AWS, GCP, and Azure, and the data foundations our agents build on.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"2583216c-ae3a-4a9e-8a7e-8b51d869008e\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"5b79a9273429\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Write production Go services that interact with cloud provider APIs, the Kubernetes control plane, and LLM APIs in real time.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"b915718c-204f-4562-a6f0-9365e62f0ff6\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"043985b51dfa\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Own features end-to-end: from design through implementation, testing, and production rollout (most projects ship in 1 to 4 weeks).</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"9f03e2ec-4fdb-481a-a2bc-a847b6c398bc\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"34dc20ea07ab\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Debug novel problems: an agent giving a wrong answer, a cross-cloud permission edge case, a data freshness issue that only appears at scale.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"2f869e83-06f2-4990-a6ca-b8051f08c167\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"958c950247f8\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Build the quality harness: evals, telemetry, feedback loops, that let us ship agent improvements without regressions.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"359ee395-8170-4032-95c4-aa78c1e5a836\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"c434315d4a61\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Contribute to product direction and backlog. Shape what gets built next, not just how it's built.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"2819f48c-a497-424c-bbbb-f4daa133ba80\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"4ab2143cb708\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Participate in the team's on-call rotation.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-local-id=\"9e3895f10f77\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"heading\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Tools We Use Daily</h2>\n<ul class=\"ak-ul\" data-local-id=\"71c9e13f-b3a4-46a6-8fd9-feb489a95838\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"bulletList\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<li data-local-id=\"6f7fecd7-4fbc-4dfb-9cd8-06a1168dd68f\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"ba332bf47cec\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><strong data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"strong\">Programming Languages:</strong> Go</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"a1f033f0-bc97-4bad-98e3-cf40874943af\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"fc718793117e\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><strong data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"strong\">AI & Agents:</strong> MCP (servers and clients), agent gateways, LLM provider APIs, RAG, evaluation pipelines</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"c1436423-bd05-4cd2-8622-c3e27d809261\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"479923a882d4\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><strong data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"strong\">Cloud & Orchestration:</strong> Kubernetes, AWS, GCP, Azure</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"a484c60b-8f81-4801-836c-42ba05ff728a\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"d4b2eff9edef\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><strong data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"strong\">Infrastructure as Code:</strong> Terraform</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"01fabc9f-227c-4ddf-a214-a514d4329c75\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"bb1f49b4ae4c\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><strong data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"strong\">Databases & Storage:</strong> PostgreSQL, Cloud Object Storage, ClickHouse</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"87076aff-5b49-4b58-8ebb-19681857b258\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"96f673ac7593\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><strong data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"strong\">Workflows & APIs:</strong> Temporal, GCP Pub/Sub, <span id=\"8cbe49c1-7d1f-4779-8cf7-b650575d4aad\" data-mark-type=\"annotation\" data-mark-annotation-type=\"inlineComment\" data-id=\"8cbe49c1-7d1f-4779-8cf7-b650575d4aad\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"annotation\">gRPC, REST</span></p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"056a0bbb-aff6-46e0-a148-609c094b95f2\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"4fd4e7d05bb0\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><strong data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"strong\">Observability & Product Analytics:</strong> Prometheus, Grafana, Loki, Tempo, PostHog</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"32f2c93e-e27b-4f04-93ba-849b8ba388b3\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"a89c7c9ebf96\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><strong data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"strong\">CI/CD & GitOps:</strong> GitLab/GitHub CI with ArgoCD and Kargo</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-local-id=\"426268d09b7d\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"heading\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">What's in it for you?</h2>\n<ul class=\"ak-ul\" data-local-id=\"45cce929-dc69-407e-8eff-e1e390037573\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"bulletList\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<li data-local-id=\"0e6453a2-d705-4e9b-86ff-070fc9dc350d\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"a50c0cabd365\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Competitive salary (€6,500 to €9,000 gross, depending on the level of experience)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"a3cfae7a-4d0a-496f-9883-f2265d641a94\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"561a01a9a602\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Work on genuinely new problems: production MCP platforms and AI assistants for Kubernetes and cloud infrastructure are not solved domains. You'll be defining them, not following a playbook.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"dfc6260a-4241-478b-99e4-643a0bbdd80c\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"7ee85380230a\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Equity options.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"72c6e07d-999f-4047-bfbc-16628f806520\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"fc371cb44b33\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Real users, fast: your work ships to hundreds of organizations in weeks, not quarters.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"53d2a142-a824-4483-8bae-40f52d974553\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"95e586e0da11\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Enjoy a flexible, remote-first global environment.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"831d3050-f028-4c51-8de6-b5216117ff0b\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"b2c3a847e4e5\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Collaborate with a global team of cloud experts and innovators, passionate about pushing the boundaries of Kubernetes technology.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"83c31e32-3fde-4c34-8dde-81a8dcbf0e60\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"ca2a68cd536a\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Spend 10% of your work time on personal projects or self-improvement.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"b707593d-777c-4f77-b3b6-efa7321721b3\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"a65483dda71e\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Learning budget for professional and personal development, including access to international conferences and courses.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"70b3ad1e-4df9-40ce-a292-51af2d079587\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"828b123688b4\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Annual hackathon to spark new ideas and strengthen team bonds.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"c87131ce-88a4-4866-847b-398d8192b5b7\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"980361b5c7ce\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Team-building budget and company events to connect with your colleagues.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"2092f0ad-28a5-4892-84d2-3f9f1155d080\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"7032e8ced4a2\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Equipment budget to ensure you have everything you need.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"15a2079e-49d3-428e-b5bd-5a6463c15647\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"77c4d511850f\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Extra days off to help maintain a healthy work-life balance.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-local-id=\"628fba58807d\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"heading\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Hiring process</h2>\n<ol class=\"ak-ol\" data-local-id=\"788a3995-fda6-4e6e-99b8-653b85b55d2e\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"orderedList\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<li data-local-id=\"6ad59bdd-d9d3-4a7f-b578-9e5404a64198\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"8dd32dd35ffc\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Screening call with Recruiter</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"2aa23c38-904d-477d-a9b9-4f064f9d2fc2\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"33509bc6de33\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Hiring Manager interview</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"37d72b3c-95f9-494f-ac63-7de18aaa570c\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"7f01c3c62697\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Technical interview (system design)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"6a941964-152a-4718-be9b-3977152023fb\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"cf75cadf318d\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Live coding</p>\n</li>\n<li data-local-id=\"6bf27c0f-2a9b-402d-8f9d-4b945a841e8a\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"listItem\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">\n<p data-local-id=\"62236c01d521\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\">Culture Check interview with an executive</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p data-local-id=\"250a6cdf7411\" data-prosemirror-content-type=\"node\" data-prosemirror-node-name=\"paragraph\" data-prosemirror-node-block=\"true\"><em data-prosemirror-content-type=\"mark\" data-prosemirror-mark-name=\"em\">As part of our standard hiring process, a background check may be conducted at the final stage of recruitment through our third-party provider, Checkr. Please note that Cast AI does not provide any form of visa sponsorship/work permit.</em></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">#LI-Remote</span></p>", "salary": "", "remote": true, "doar_remote": true, "nivel": "Senior (5-10 ani)", "limbi": []}